 in front of a  vehicle which was occupied by his mother  and his two-year-old son  as roberts ambushed our officers he shot  through the vehicle placing his  two-year-old son in danger  you can also see the impact of his  gunshots in the photo you see to my left  the details of the officer-involved  shooting  are  on monday october 4th 2021 officers were  from the lvmp's gang unit were  conducting surveillance on a vehicle  that was parked in the alley  behind the 4100 block of silver dollar  this vehicle had previously previously  fled from officers during an earlier  traffic stop  the officers conducted their  surveillance we're in an unmarked  vehicle and were dressed in plain  clothes  at approximately 6 38 pm  a woman and a man demetrius roberts the  suspect were seen walking towards the  vehicle that the officers were  surveilling  robertson the woman appeared to be  having an argument and roberts is seen  by the officers grabbing the woman by  the arms  the plainclothes officers announced this  information over the radio  and requested a mark patrol unit to  respond  officer darren young and officer joel  blasker were riding together in a marked  patrol vehicle  and arrived in the alley seconds after  the request was made by the plainclothes  officers  as officers young and blasphemer were  exiting their patrol vehicle  roberts took a position of cover behind  a vehicle and opened fire towards the  officers  officer young returned fire  as he ran to find cover  his handgun had a malfunction but he was  able to clear it  after shooting at the officers  roberts ran away towards pennwood arvol  excuse me pennwood avenue  both officers chased roberts as he ran  between two apartments  two apartment buildings  officer belasco was running directly  behind roberts and officer young took a  different route  to cut off roberts's path  once on pennwood avenue roberts took  cover behind another vehicle and fired  his gun at one of the officers  both officer young and blasco fired  their guns towards roberts  once again officer young had a  malfunction of his weapon  officer young cleared the malfunction  and fired his gun for a third time  towards roberts as he was running away  with the firearm in his hand  roberts was stuck struck by the gunfire  and fell to the ground and officers  immediately responded  and  provided first aid  medical personnel pronounced  roberts deceased at the scene  the woman involved in this incident was  also struck by gunfire  she was transported to umc trauma where  she was treated for injuries and later  released  an officer was treated and released by  medical personnel at the scene after  being struck by shrapnel  i will now show you the body worn camera  video of the officer-involved shooting  after it's done playing i will take the  time to slow down the video and explain  what's occurring  [Music]  control d61 shots fired off in the  advent 4156  [Music]  did you know that suspect  [Music]  get down man  [Music]  so as you can see that happened really  quickly and it's hard to to see  everything that happened so i'll try to  slow it down a little bit for you as  officers are arriving there's no audio  because it takes 30 seconds for our  audio to kick in on body worn cameras so  as immediately they start taking fire  the officer has the malfunction he  clears it  meanwhile the suspect's running around  the other side of this building  officer blasco was in for pursuit  officer young right here on his radio  then goes around the other side of this  building  to try to cut the suspect off  so there's the suspect at the front of  this van you could see him the both the  officer and the suspect were using that  van as cover unbeknownst to the officer  so he he fires one round has another  malfunction clears that from behind the  vehicle  and then the suspects on the other side  of the van crossing the street  this concludes the briefing  does anyone have any questions  yes uh might be a dumb question but the  white vehicle that you showed that has  the  impacts to it yes is that a police  vehicle or is that whose vehicle is that  that's uh the suspect's mother's vehicle  i believe but that's the vehicle she was  driving  and the angle is the suspect's in the  front of that car and the officers are  getting out of their patrol vehicle  behind okay and then i believe you said  that showed the impacts of the bullets  coming through the vehicle is it  do you have are those bullets that  officers fired or was he firing from  within the vehicle or do you understand  the particulars yeah so the suspect was  firing from the front of the vehicle  towards the officers through the vehicle  the mother turned out not to be a very  good witness because she was  covering the two-year-old child to make  sure that she wouldn't be hit by the  bullets  just so i understand that the  suspect was firing was outside the  vehicle and firing through the vehicle  that's correct  and  did you find the shell casings and all  that from his from his weapon there yes  all the the suspects uh shell casings  are at the front of the vehicle eight of  them and then one is on pennwood  avenue and are you aware of any  significant criminal history or violent  uh activity on behalf of this individual  previously  so we don't discuss the the criminal  history of the  suspect  so i'm not going to get into that right  now  um  but he is from nevada and  that's all i'll say  and what was his two-year-old  child doing there and why was the mom's  car involved uh if you don't mind  explaining a little bit more about why  you're in the area why there was a child  leading up to this altercation sure the  female involved was the  ex-girlfriend of the suspect and she  lived there and mom was bringing the  child over to that address and  everything occurred in the alley  and we know that domestic violence has  just been on a rise this past few years  for example domestic violence homicide  also climbing wi